{"seq":7,"id":"01M8EDAQKM71RREHBR95A2VDC4","cdr":"CDR-0004","attempt":"CDR-0004-A1","type":"agent.result","actor":{"kind":"agent","id":"test_author","adapter":"claude-sonnet"},"at":"2026-11-27T11:47:55.124Z","payload":{"role":"test_author","adapter":"claude-sonnet","result_sha256":"d0430f334dd50fe0cb7abb0a44e4d86fbf0e3fff6af7b1e0df3771e97417b61b","result":{"tests":[{"path":"scripts/design-md.cdr0004.test.mjs","covers_criterion":"All 11 criteria, each with at least one test: (1) the kit-usage section before the colour section; (2) the catalog-driven component table with purposes, and refusal on a missing purpose, a blank or stale one, or a missing catalog; (3) final --sl-text-on-accent colours that follow the source accent, threshold and dark pole; (4) no private property in DESIGN.md; (5) the generator throws and writes nothing on a private var(); (6) --sl-shadow-inset and --sl-measure printed and read from the sources; (7) the header product-name rule; (8) accent registry headers and the spexr fill sentence; (9) the settings and form rule in L2 and in DESIGN.md; (10) the six pixel face uses and the role-not-size note; (11) the committed file equals a deterministic build, with no date, owner or amendment text, and the approval recorded in design-language.md."}],"run_command":"node --test scripts/design-md.cdr0004.test.mjs","notes":"I had no tool for running commands, so I have not run these tests. I expect each one to fail on the current code, based on reading the generator, DESIGN.md and the sources.\n\nThe mutation tests copy the root files plus `scripts/`, `docs/` and `packages/` into a temp directory, then run the generator there. A new source file must be inside one of those paths. Some edits are also applied to generated CSS (`tokens.css`, `themes/*.css`, `components.css`), so the generator may read either the JSON or the CSS. For the accent, threshold, pole and shadow cases, the tests edit `sondalab.tokens.json` and the matching CSS. For the measure, they edit `design-language.md` and `components.css`. The generator must not fail just because other generated files, such as `neutrals.json`, were not regenerated after such an edit.\n\nFormat the output must follow:\n- **Kit section:** a `## ` section before the Colour section. It names `tokens.css`, `components.css`, `themes/{light,dark,high-contrast,products}.css` and `fonts.css`, each spelled out, with no brace shorthand. `tokens.css` comes first, then `components.css`, then the themes. It uses the word \"order\", says \"root\" and \"class\", and says \"never rebuild\" or \"do not rebuild\".\n- **Component table:** its headers include one matching \"Class\" and one matching \"Purpose\". Every row has a purpose.\n- **Purpose source:** it can be a `purpose` field on every entry in `catalog.json`, in which case a blank one must throw. Otherwise it is keyed by component id, in which case a stale id must throw. A missing `catalog.json` must always throw.\n- **`--sl-text-on-accent` row:** keep the column order Light, Dark, High contrast. Cells can be hex, `rgb()`, `white`, `black` or a literal `oklch(L 0 h)`.\n- **Inset shadow:** one `## ` section names `--sl-shadow-inset`, mentions light and dark, and prints every theme's value.\n- **Measure:** `--sl-measure` and its value are on the same line.\n- **Product-name rule:** one line that includes \"product name\" or \"product mark\", \"header\" or \"title bar\", \"display face\" or `--sl-font-display`, \"700\", \"accent dot\", \"wordmark\", \"brand-face\" or `--sl-font-brand`, and \"brand alone\".\n- **Accent registry:** no header is a bare Light, Dark or Note. The light and dark accent headers each contain \"accent\". The spexr sentence is outside the table and mentions spexr, fill, white and label.\n- **Settings rule:** in both documents it begins \"Settings and form screens\" (or \"Settings \u0026 form\") and keeps all its parts before the next `##` or deeper heading. Use the CDR's wording: \"one main pane\", \"two columns\", \"two control columns\", \"1px hairlines\", \"never cards\" or \"no cards\", \"primary Save\". In L2, a single line has \"settings\", \"owner\", \"approved\" and \"2026-11-27\".\n- **Pixel face:** the Typography section uses \"section index\", \"card folio\", \"step number\", \"stat value\", \"compact lockup\" and \"emphasised heading word\". It also says \"about role, not size\", and that a \"micro section index\" stays \"mono\" in the same sentence."}},"cost":{"tokens_in":16,"tokens_out":19513,"tokens_cache_write":132595,"tokens_cache_read":587300,"seconds":139.88040125,"usd":0.784272},"signer":"ads-team:marcello.barile@gmail.com","prev_hash":"f44357601242aa88598565f6ed6c8c6fb21ef1ae529c79c2427fe60e72e5200b","hash":"46775c18478b3eb3b88a5b12f595fd3cc106119979ea363095d3e201df2faa16","sig":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgt+9LVHCb4CLBAIrBcP4iIkhhc+\nSCDbAr1oNRi9kG2bAAAAAJYWRzLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1l\nZDI1NTE5AAAAQNajyHay1OVlF2V9FoN64vHK3lErDv+qwEDSwlWLROXbEOy6lYB+Tcks9y\ndtHsG1zBKY+rwS+X625qDDE812kQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----\n"}
